1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,453
Every indicator changes colour over its own pH range.

2
00:00:04,453 --> 00:00:08,059
Methyl orange, three point one to four point four.

3
00:00:08,059 --> 00:00:11,354
Phenolphthalein, eight point three to ten.

4
00:00:11,354 --> 00:00:18,255
For a strong acid and a strong base, the jump covers both ranges, so either indicator works.

